#: About/AboutPage.php:60
#, fuzzy
msgid "Deliverability plugin is a simple and user-friendly WordPress plugin that helps improve email deliverability by signing messages with DKIM and monitoring key Email Authentication an Reputation metrics. With this plugin, you can easily set up DKIM signing for your domain."
msgstr "I-plugin yokulethwa iyi-plugin elula futhi esebenziseka kalula ye-WordPress esiza ukuthuthukisa ukulethwa kwe-imeyili ngokusayina imiyalezo nge-DKIM nokuqapha ukhiye we-imeyili Ukuqinisekiswa kwedumela amamethrikhi. Ngale plugin, ungasetha kalula ukusayina kwe-DKIM yesizinda sakho."

#: About/AboutPage.php:67
#, fuzzy
msgid "Once installed, the plugin will automatically scan your deliverability settings and provide you with a detailed breakdown of their status. The plugin then displays these metrics in an easy-to-read dashboard, allowing users to quickly see how their email deliverability is performing and identify areas for improvement. This information will help you identify potential issues and take steps to improve the deliverability of your emails."
msgstr "Uma ifakiwe, i-plugin izoskena ngokuzenzakalelayo izilungiselelo zakho zokulethwa futhi ikunikeze ukuqhekeka okuningiliziwe kwesimo sabo. I-plugin bese ibonisa lezi zilinganiso kudeshibhodi elula ukuyifunda, ivumela abasebenzisi ukuthi babone ngokushesha ukuthi ukulethwa kwabo kwe-imeyili kwenza kanjani futhi babone izindawo zokuthuthukisa. Lolu lwazi luzokusiza ukuthi ukhombe izindaba ezingaba khona futhi uthathe izinyathelo zokuthuthukisa ukulethwa kwama-imeyili akho."

#: About/AboutPage.php:74
#, fuzzy
msgid "Overall, Deliverability plugin is a valuable tool for anyone looking to improve their email deliverability and ensure that their messages reach their intended recipients. Its simple and intuitive design makes it easy to use, even for those with little technical expertise."
msgstr "Sekukonke, i-plugin yokulethwa iyithuluzi eliyigugu kunoma ubani ofuna ukuthuthukisa ukulethwa kwabo kwe-imeyili futhi aqinisekise ukuthi imiyalezo yabo ifinyelela abamukeli babo abahlosiwe. Umklamo wayo olula futhi onembile wenza kube lula ukuyisebenzisa, ngisho nakulabo abanobuchwepheshe obuncane bobuchwepheshe."

