#: Dashboard/DashboardPage.php:224
#, fuzzy
msgid "An email deliverability score is a measure of how likely it is that an email will be successfully delivered to the recipient's inbox. This score is typically based on a variety of factors, such as the sender's reputation, the quality of the email content, and the server and network infrastructure used to send the email. A high deliverability score indicates that the email has a good chance of being delivered, while a low score may indicate that the email may end up in the recipient's spam folder or may not be delivered at all."
msgstr "Isikolo sokulethwa kwe-imeyili siyisilinganiso sokuthi kungenzeka kangakanani ukuthi i-imeyili izohanjiswa ngempumelelo ebhokisini lokungenayo lomukeli. Lesi sikolo ngokuvamile sisekelwe ezintweni ezihlukahlukene, njengedumela lomthumeli, ikhwalithi yokuqukethwe kwe-imeyili, kanye nengqalasizinda yeseva nenethiwekhi esetshenziselwa ukuthumela i-imeyili. Isikolo esiphezulu sokulethwa sibonisa ukuthi i-imeyili inethuba elihle lokulethwa, kuyilapho isikolo esiphansi singakhombisa ukuthi i-imeyili ingagcina kufolda yogaxekile yomukeli noma ingahanjiswa nhlobo."

